#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:5
msgid "Untie master item"
msgstr "解除主元件项绑定"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:7
msgid ""
"Some times is necessary to delete previous work, QElectroTech allows "
"breaking/deleting `links between elements (cross references)`_."
msgstr ""
"有时需要删除之前的工作。QElectroTech 允许断开或删除 `元件之间的链接（交叉引用） <links between elements "
"(cross references)_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:10
msgid "A `master element`_ can be unlinked from a `slave element`_ as follow:"
msgstr "`主元件 <master element_>`_ 可按以下步骤与 `从元件 <slave element_>`_ 解除链接："

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:12
msgid ""
"Select the `Slave element`_ which should be unlinked from the `project "
"collection`_ or from the `workspace`_."
msgstr ""
"从 `项目集合 <project collection_>`_ 或 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中选择要解除链接的 `从元件 <Slave "
"element_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:13
msgid ""
"Right click on the selected `element`_ and choose the option **Edit the "
"element**."
msgstr "右键单击选中的 `元件 <element_>`_ ，选择 **编辑元件** 选项。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element options"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元件选项"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:20
msgid ""
"`Display`_ the **Cross-reference (Slave)** tab from the element editor PopUP"
" window"
msgstr "在元件编辑器弹出窗口中 `显示 <Display_>`_ **交叉引用（从元件）** 标签页"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:25
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech cross reference tab element properties"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 交叉引用标签页中的元件属性"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:27
msgid ""
"Press **Unlink** to delete the `cross reference`_ with the `master "
"element`_."
msgstr ""
"按 **解除链接** 删除与 `主元件 <master element_>`_ 的 `交叉引用 <cross reference_>`_ 。"

#: ../../source/users/schema/element/references/slave_item_untie.rst:28
msgid "Press **Apply** to accept and save the changes."
msgstr "按 **Apply** 接受并保存更改。"
